    "problemStatement": "Frequency Of Element\nWrite a program to count the frequency of element in the array",
    "constraints": [
      "1 <= n <= 100",
      "0 <= arr[i] <= 10^18"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line contains the number of elements.\n\nSecond line has the array elements.",
    "outputFormat": "Print the number and Frequency of that number separate them by COLON",
    "notes": [],
